+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "https everywhere, no exceptions": plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts, and internal hosts are held to the same HTTPS requirement as every other host. This is consistent with the separately recorded decision that certificate verification stays on in all builds.
